title: 'sc-rpc-spec-v2: terminate archive storage tasks after disconnect'
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
  description: |-
    Ensure archive storage subscriptions release their bounded-channel receiver when the client
    disconnects, so the storage producer can stop instead of retaining a subscription task and a
    blocking-pool thread indefinitely.
crates:
- name: sc-rpc-spec-v2
  bump: patch
